1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,700
Every great event starts with an idea.

2
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:08,875
But turning that idea into reality takes resources, partnerships, and financial support.

3
00:00:08,875 --> 00:00:14,087
For many organizers, finding the right sponsors is one of the biggest challenges.

4
00:00:14,186 --> 00:00:25,511
Organizers often spend countless hours researching companies, preparing sponsorship proposals, and sending outreach messages without knowing whether those sponsors are actually relevant to their events.

5
00:00:25,511 --> 00:00:31,673
Meanwhile, businesses struggle to discover events that genuinely match their audience and objectives.

6
00:00:31,673 --> 00:00:34,761
What if sponsorship discovery could be smarter?

7
00:00:34,874 --> 00:00:44,399
Introducing FESTIVALMINT, an AI-powered sponsorship marketplace that brings event organizers and potential sponsors together in one connected experience.

8
00:00:44,498 --> 00:00:51,335
With FESTIVALMINT, organizers can manage their events and create sponsorship opportunities that fit their goals.

9
00:00:51,335 --> 00:00:59,835
Our Gemini-powered AI helps generate sponsorship package suggestions, including potential benefits, requirements, and pricing guidance.

10
00:00:59,835 --> 00:01:06,373
Organizers remain in control, choosing what to offer and what each sponsorship opportunity is worth.

11
00:01:06,482 --> 00:01:12,607
FESTIVALMINT uses Google Gemini to help connect organizers and sponsors through intelligent matching.

12
00:01:12,607 --> 00:01:20,057
Organizers can discover potential sponsors, while businesses can explore events that align with their interests and objectives.

13
00:01:20,057 --> 00:01:26,357
It also helps prepare personalized sponsorship outreach, making the partnership process more efficient.

14
00:01:26,474 --> 00:01:35,524
Once a sponsor finds the right opportunity, they can review its benefits, submit a proposal, and proceed through our integrated PayPal checkout.

15
00:01:35,524 --> 00:01:41,961
PayPal Sandbox allows us to demonstrate the sponsorship payment journey securely without processing real money.

16
00:01:42,074 --> 00:01:44,561
And the journey doesn't end at payment.

17
00:01:44,561 --> 00:01:51,849
FESTIVALMINT helps organize sponsorship commitments, track deliverables, and manage partnership progress in one place.

18
00:01:51,962 --> 00:02:03,524
Powered by Google Gemini, integrated with the PayPal Developer Platform, and built with modern web technologies, FESTIVALMINT brings intelligent sponsorship discovery and digital payments together.

19
00:02:03,524 --> 00:02:06,874
Because great events deserve more than just an idea.

20
00:02:06,874 --> 00:02:08,937
They deserve the right partners.
